+  `small_biz.blend`, `campus.blend`, `host.blend`, `puck.blend`.
+- **Exports:** render at 256×256 with the §0 contract, export PNGs into
+  `assets/sprites/` with the fixed names (`house_0..3`, `host`, `dc`,
+  `puck_1..3`, `small_biz`, `campus` — 11 files, order is pinned in
